---
// ProblemStatement.astro — "Why now" narrative between Hero and code showcase
---

<section class="section-pad problem-section">
  <div class="section-inner">
    <span class="section-eyebrow" data-reveal>HARNESS VS RUNTIME</span>
    <h2 class="section-title problem-headline" data-reveal data-reveal-delay="1">
      You picked a harness. Now what runs it?
    </h2>
    <p class="problem-lede" data-reveal data-reveal-delay="2">
      Harnesses &mdash; <em>Pydantic AI, LangGraph, Claude Agent SDK, or your own</em> &mdash; own the inner loop. The runtime underneath gets rebuilt from scratch, company by company.
    </p>

    <div class="problem-grid">

      <div class="why-card" data-reveal="scale-up" data-reveal-delay="3">
        <div class="card-glow"></div>
        <div class="why-card-image">
          <img src="https://assets.kitaru.ai/content/site/34447ad2/k-prob-1-800.avif" srcset="https://assets.kitaru.ai/content/site/2cc2883d/k-prob-1-sm.avif 664w, https://assets.kitaru.ai/content/site/34447ad2/k-prob-1-800.avif 800w" alt="Durable agent state" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="400" height="225" sizes="(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 33vw" onerror="this.style.display='none'" />
        </div>
        <div class="why-card-content">
          <span class="why-card-tag">State</span>
          <h3>Runs your agents can come back to.</h3>
          <p>Every checkpoint records the state needed to inspect, replay, or resume a run. A crash does not erase the trail: you can see what happened, reuse completed work, and continue from a known point.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="why-card" data-reveal="scale-up" data-reveal-delay="4">
        <div class="card-glow"></div>
        <div class="why-card-image">
          <img src="https://assets.kitaru.ai/content/site/80283a6e/k-prob-2-800.avif" srcset="https://assets.kitaru.ai/content/site/bfd1b9bd/k-prob-2-sm.avif 664w, https://assets.kitaru.ai/content/site/80283a6e/k-prob-2-800.avif 800w" alt="One agent, three runtimes" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="400" height="225" sizes="(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 33vw" onerror="this.style.display='none'" />
        </div>
        <div class="why-card-content">
          <span class="why-card-tag">Deployment</span>
          <h3>Deploy once. Invoke anywhere.</h3>
          <p><code>flow.deploy()</code> captures an immutable versioned snapshot. Consumers invoke by flow name &mdash; from CLI, Python, MCP, or a generated curl &mdash; with tag routing for rollout and rollback.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="why-card" data-reveal="scale-up" data-reveal-delay="5">
        <div class="card-glow"></div>
        <div class="why-card-image">
          <img src="https://assets.kitaru.ai/content/site/79a5c5af/k-prob-3-800.avif" srcset="https://assets.kitaru.ai/content/site/71979af8/k-prob-3-sm.avif 664w, https://assets.kitaru.ai/content/site/79a5c5af/k-prob-3-800.avif 800w" alt="Runs you can actually compare" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="400" height="225" sizes="(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 33vw" onerror="this.style.display='none'" />
        </div>
        <div class="why-card-content">
          <span class="why-card-tag">Artifacts</span>
          <h3>Inspect every run.</h3>
          <p>Every checkpoint writes a typed, versioned artifact you can diff across runs. Trace a bad output back to the exact step and inputs that made it. Built in, not bolted on.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .problem-section {
    background: var(--color-bg);
  }

  .problem-headline {
    max-width: 740px;
  }

  .problem-lede {
    max-width: 740px;
    margin-top: 20px;
    font-size: clamp(0.98rem, 1.5vw, 1.1rem);
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--color-secondary);
    font-weight: 300;
  }

  .problem-lede em {
    font-style: normal;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-primary);
  }

  .problem-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 20px;
    margin-top: 48px;
  }

  .why-card-tag {
    display: inline-block;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-accent);
    padding: 3px 9px;
    background: oklch(0.65 0.16 45 / 0.08);
    border: 1px solid oklch(0.65 0.16 45 / 0.2);
    border-radius: 100px;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }


  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .problem-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>

<script>
  import { setupCardGlow } from '../scripts/card-glow';
  setupCardGlow('.problem-section .why-card');
</script>
